              <p>📍 &nbsp; <strong>Location:</strong> Shaikpet Main Road, Hyderabad, Telangana</p>
              <p>📞 &nbsp; <strong>Phone:</strong> +91 98765 43210</p>
              <p>✉ &nbsp; <strong>Email:</strong> hello@mitrainteriors.in</p>
              <p>🕘 &nbsp; <strong>Hours:</strong> Mon&ndash;Sat, 9:30 AM &ndash; 7:00 PM</p>
            </div>
            <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Shaikpet%20Main%20Road,%20Hyderabad,%20Telangana" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-gold btn-directions">
              Get Directions &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>